          <div class="aalto-hub-desc__body">
            <h2 id="hub-desc-title-id-654484922" class="aalto-hub-desc__header">World-class research with high impact</h2>
            
                    <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><p>The Department of Chemistry and Materials Science focuses on micro-, nano- and atomic scale engineering of compounds and materials. Our work in these areas encompasses synthesis, characterization and computational research.</p></div>
            
