          <h2 class="aalto-manual-liftup__header-title" id="liftup-title-id-1040670875">            Research
      </h2>
              <div class="aalto-manual-liftup__header-body">            <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><p>The research in the department focuses on advanced and functional materials, chemical synthesis, energy storage and conversion, as well as, molecular and materials modelling. Our teaching provides students a solid background for these topics.</p></div>
